    },
    {
      "fingerprint": "1f6aa7e942d09140c40d37f15ac2ee5c5fcd97cf505e9dee802355e7299aef23",
      "note": "The form markup is returned by LTIAAS from POST /api/deeplinking/form and is a self-submitting form that has to render as HTML. Nothing is interpolated into it locally; the values we send are signed into a JWT by LTIAAS. Trusting that response is inherent to the integration."
    },
    {
